{"mode":"words","text":"Od tohto bodu záleží na tvojom cieli v učení. Ak chceš jazyk len rozumieť, cieľ si už dosiahol – jednoducho zostan pri krokoch dva a tri. Ak chceš hovoriť, nasleduje hovorenie v zbore: Vyber si pomocou opakovania A-B krátku vetu, nastav rýchlosť na úplne pomalú a hovor súčasne s hlasom – ako v zbore. Hneď počuješ, ak niečo znie inak, a sám seba automaticky opravíš. To funguje kdekoľvek, dokonca aj v električke: so slúchadlami to znie ako telefonát. A ak sa chceš naučiť písať, jednoducho si text prepisuj veta po vete.","words":[{"s":0,"e":186},{"s":221,"e":522},{"s":592,"e":964},{"s":1080,"e":1533},{"s":1579,"e":1660},{"s":1695,"e":1985},{"s":2055,"e":2345},{"s":2380,"e":2403},{"s":2473,"e":3100},{"s":3541,"e":3715},{"s":3738,"e":4005},{"s":4087,"e":4481},{"s":4598,"e":4702},{"s":4783,"e":5422},{"s":5492,"e":5793},{"s":5875,"e":5979},{"s":6049,"e":6142},{"s":6188,"e":6792},{"s":6966,"e":7012},{"s":7291,"e":7802},{"s":7848,"e":8208},{"s":8290,"e":8429},{"s":8475,"e":8858},{"s":8905,"e":9218},{"s":9334,"e":9427},{"s":9497,"e":9903},{"s":10507,"e":10693},{"s":10716,"e":10995},{"s":11076,"e":11610},{"s":11680,"e":12249},{"s":12295,"e":12771},{"s":12806,"e":12829},{"s":12864,"e":13410},{"s":13793,"e":14118},{"s":14188,"e":14269},{"s":14327,"e":14745},{"s":14815,"e":15465},{"s":15535,"e":15732},{"s":15883,"e":16324},{"s":16370,"e":16881},{"s":17206,"e":17601},{"s":17648,"e":18170},{"s":18228,"e":18309},{"s":18379,"e":18704},{"s":18751,"e":19273},{"s":19656,"e":19749},{"s":19819,"e":20132},{"s":20202,"e":20724},{"s":20759,"e":20782},{"s":20829,"e":21270},{"s":21421,"e":21537},{"s":21653,"e":21897},{"s":21932,"e":21955},{"s":22025,"e":22593},{"s":23197,"e":23476},{"s":23545,"e":24114},{"s":24161,"e":24277},{"s":24335,"e":24614},{"s":24648,"e":24811},{"s":24869,"e":25333},{"s":25508,"e":25589},{"s":25658,"e":25867},{"s":25937,"e":26204},{"s":26262,"e":26936},{"s":26982,"e":27702},{"s":28306,"e":28445},{"s":28491,"e":28909},{"s":28932,"e":29745},{"s":29